    "intro": "Good spa names sound calm and say what kind of spa you are: a day spa, a med spa or a wellness studio. The **Spa Name Generator** suggests names for a day spa, med spa, aesthetics clinic or wellness studio: catchy, cute, classic, modern, luxury, med spa, your town or your own name.",
